Original commit body from f1f0033:

PyPI renders README.md but doesn't host repository files, so relative
links like `docs/LANGUAGES.md` were broken. Convert all relative links
to absolute Codeberg URLs:

- docs/*.md links → codeberg.org/.../src/branch/main/docs/*.md
- Root files (AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG.md, etc.) → absolute URLs
- Logo image → raw/branch/main/... for direct image serving
- LICENSE → absolute URL

This ensures links work both on Codeberg and PyPI.
